  "description": "The Pamir is your ultimate companion for endless journeys. As part of our E-Expedition series, it blends cutting-edge technology with unmatched versatility. Powered by the innovative Pinion E-Drive system, which seamlessly integrates motor and gearbox, every ride feels smooth, powerful, and effortless. Crafted in Europe, its lightweight aluminum frame features an integrated battery compartment and space for an optional range extender, so you can go even further. With modular pannier racks, all-road tire options, and extensive customization possibilities—from comfort to components—the Pamir adapts perfectly to your riding style. Whether you're setting off on a grand expedition or tackling your daily commute, configure your Pamir to fit your needs and ride without limits!",
